<title>POLAND: REMAK SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>REMAK SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.09 vs   0.40</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.14 vs   1.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.08 vs   2.12</p>
<p> Sales		    7.44 vs  11.56</p>
<p> JANUARY-SEPTEMBER    1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.57 vs   1.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.74 vs   3.93</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.34 vs   4.36 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   55.14 vs  79.06</p>
<p>Note: Full name of the Polish construction company is Remak</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
